{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinite Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Deprived</i></strong>, you find yourself trapped inside what seems to be an ordinary house. But as soon as you take your first steps, you\u2019ll realize paranormal anomalies have consumed it. Caught in an endless loop, your only way forward is to <strong>locate and capture these anomalies</strong> to progress through the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/extras/ebccd84e2c7281ef86b0dd280e3cb84d.poster.avif?t=1771829501\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/extras/ebccd84e2c7281ef86b0dd280e3cb84d.webm?t=1771829501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/extras/ebccd84e2c7281ef86b0dd280e3cb84d.mp4?t=1771829501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve dealt with the anomalies, your goal is to find the<strong> red door </strong>and escape the house. But every time you think you\u2019ve made it out, the house resets, this time filled with even <strong>more anomalies</strong>.\u00a0Keep moving forward; eventually, the loop might break, and you may be able to escape...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/extras/16cdcf634decfc3d4557a861b90bf0d7.poster.avif?t=1771829501\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/extras/16cdcf634decfc3d4557a861b90bf0d7.webm?t=1771829501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/extras/16cdcf634decfc3d4557a861b90bf0d7.mp4?t=1771829501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use the environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be careful with your sanity</strong>. The longer you remain in the same house, the more it decreases, triggering disturbing effects that will impact your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/extras/72933f682239df1e97221afc0be93745.poster.avif?t=1771829501\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/extras/72933f682239df1e97221afc0be93745.webm?t=1771829501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/extras/72933f682239df1e97221afc0be93745.mp4?t=1771829501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay Alert</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies are not the only things in the house. Strange noises and movements suggest that something else is lurking in the hallways\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/extras/74a1c81919844ec5cc979c7abce7aaa9.poster.avif?t=1771829501\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/extras/74a1c81919844ec5cc979c7abce7aaa9.webm?t=1771829501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/extras/74a1c81919844ec5cc979c7abce7aaa9.mp4?t=1771829501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy the Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final game is still in development, so add it to your wishlist to make sure you don\u2019t miss the full version.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087780?t=1771829501","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/e2a4dba6b70c20cdfb3061e7236c22a9fb6b3310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771829501","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/df1e25f50aaeca20e91324d177b1abfcf4027d39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771829501","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/df1e25f50aaeca20e91324d177b1abfcf4027d39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771829501","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4094960,"description":""},{"appid":4094960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infinite Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Deprived</i></strong>, you find yourself trapped inside what seems to be an ordinary house. But as soon as you take your first steps, you\u2019ll realize paranormal anomalies have consumed it. Caught in an endless loop, your only way forward is to <strong>locate and capture these anomalies</strong> to progress through the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087780/extras/ebccd84e2c7281ef86b0dd280e3cb84d.poster.avif?t=1771829501\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/408